Package: tidymapr
Title: Tidy Mapping Verbs for Biodiversity and Spatial Ecology
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Jimmy", "Moses", , "jimmy.moses@pnguot.ac.pg", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Tidy, pipe-friendly mapping verbs for biodiversity and
    spatial ecology. Designed to work with 'tidydiversity' in the same way
    that 'dplyr' and 'ggplot2' do: load both packages and keep a single
    workflow. Mapping features now in 'tidydiversity' will move here, and
    'tidydiversity' will re-export the verbs users need so existing
    pipelines keep working.
